          },
          "\n\\mathcal A_{n,r}=\\left(\\frac{\\omega_{n+r}}{\\omega_n}\\right)^{1/(2r)},\n\\qquad\n\\mathcal B_{n,r}=\\log\\frac{V_{n-1}V_n}{V_{n+r-1}V_{n+r}}.\n"
